"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I’m sad because I didn’t get the chance⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫to show my gratitude to people "
"very dear to me.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫« Je suis triste parce que je n’ai pas eu la chance⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫de témoigner ma "
